# text.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller,
# against fl-engine's frame through emblema, both at DPR 2. Percent of
# pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# Layout matches (the metrics program holds it to the stock engine's
# numbers); glyph edges do not. Impeller rasterizes its atlas through Skia
# with slight hinting, a quarter-pixel subpixel position and Skia's own
# coverage, where fl-engine rasterizes with swash, unhinted, on whole
# pixels: small text comes out 5 to 9 percent heavier in ink, and up to a
# third of a pixel off. Outlines (the 160 px glyphs, past the atlas) and
# the icons agree. Measured 2026-10-31, lavapipe: 3.132% differ, 1.365%
# by more than 32.
differ 4.0
differ_over_32 1.6
